            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ezera ku yaabaire naashaba, naayatura ebibi, naarira naayetuura ahansi omu maisho g'enju ya Ruhanga, omutwe muhango munonga gw'abashaija n'abakazi n'abaana gwaruga omuri Israeli, gwateeranira ah'ari; kandi abo bantu nabo baarira munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.9.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 9:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Shekania mwene Yehieli, ow'omuri beene Elamu, yaagambira Ezera ati: Tucumwire ahari Ruhanga waitu, twashwera abakazi b'abanyamahanga, kwonka n'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, na hati tukiine amatsiko ahabwa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
