            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo ka turagaane na Ruhanga waitu, tushende abakazi abo boona n'abaana baabo, nk'obwengye bwa mukama wangye n'obw'abarikutetema ahabw'ekiragiro kya Ruhanga waitu, oku buri; kandi ka kikorwe, nk'oku ebiragiro birikuragiira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imuka ahakuba n'omurimo gwawe, kandi naitwe tukwataniise naiwe; ba ow'amaani, okikore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
